# Weyland-Yutani PMC crash-landing survivors (Solaris Ridge "crashlanding offices" insert).
#
# Only the strings the role bodies/jobs need. The insert's briefing/story text is not ported.

cmu-job-name-wy-pmc-synth = PMC Support Synthetic (WY Syn)
cmu-wy-pmc-survivor-synth-greeting = You are a Weyland-Yutani support synthetic assigned to a PMC detachment. Your ship was en route to the colony to escort an Assistant Manager when the colony sent a distress signal. On atmospheric entry the engine failed and the ship came down on the colony surface. Your escort detail lies dead beside you, but some are missing. Find out what happened to the colony, look for the other survivors, and find a way to contact Weyland-Yutani.
cmu-wy-pmc-survivor-rules = You are a survivor of a crash landing. You are not aware of the xenomorph threat. Your primary objective is to survive, find the other survivors of your ship, and contact Weyland-Yutani.
